// Built-in trust anchors for the MoorAI MCP catalogue: base64 SPKI DER ed25519 public keys.
//
// EMPTY ON PURPOSE. The publisher key is generated by the catalogue owner (never in this repository) and
// added here when the first signed catalogue is published. Until then a device trusts a catalogue only
// through a key it was given out of band: the signed policy's mcpCatalogue.publicKeys, the
// MOORAI_CATALOGUE_PUBKEY environment variable (MDM), or the root-owned /etc/moorai/catalogue.pub.
export const BUILTIN_CATALOGUE_KEYS = [];
